docs/tracking/season-competition-loop-design.md:row v0\.[23] is out of order # Root CLAUDE.md 'Design supplements': frozen at convergence — the July promotion row precedes the AR rows it records, same inversion as the three suppressed above
docs/tracking/training-system-design.md:row v0\.8 is out of order # Frozen supplement, same governance rule — the v0.8 row was appended at a later promotion event after the frozen v0.1/v0.3/v0.2 block
